WEBVTT

00:01.190 --> 00:04.150
Why can I use the Sacred Sword
in Yuna's body?

00:04.150 --> 00:05.230
I do not know.

00:05.230 --> 00:06.860
You've been chosen.

00:06.860 --> 00:10.230
You've become the true legendary hero, Touka.

00:10.230 --> 00:12.320
Me? The hero?

00:12.320 --> 00:15.700
Which means I can fulfill 
my royal duty as well.

00:15.700 --> 00:18.280
So let us wed at once! Right this instant!

00:18.280 --> 00:19.440
What are you, stupid?

00:19.440 --> 00:22.120
No freaking way can I just 
get married like that!

00:22.120 --> 00:23.860
But it is my duty!

00:23.860 --> 00:27.600
Or are you going to abandon me 
the way the last hero did?

00:27.600 --> 00:29.460
Well, I don't want that either...

00:29.460 --> 00:32.350
L-Look, now that I'm
really the legendary hero,

00:32.350 --> 00:34.830
I've got a more important mission
to deal with first.

00:34.830 --> 00:36.380
A more important mission?

00:36.380 --> 00:37.470
Yeah, that's right.

00:37.770 --> 00:41.680
<i>Until I complete my mission of enjoying 
the thighs of beautiful girls the world over,</i>

00:41.680 --> 00:43.890
<i>I can't possibly settle down!</i>

00:43.890 --> 00:45.100
And at this <i>particular</i> moment...

00:45.650 --> 00:46.980
We're in battle!

00:46.980 --> 00:48.630
That thing's still going?!

00:49.060 --> 00:52.940
The high-rank devil's spell must 
have sent it into a berserker fury.

00:53.320 --> 00:54.490
Which means...

00:54.490 --> 00:55.860
Ein Goedde!

00:55.860 --> 00:56.910
Finish it!

01:00.410 --> 01:02.460
<b><i>HE'S DEAD</i></b>

01:12.220 --> 01:13.110
<b>THE</b>

01:13.110 --> 01:13.650
<b>LEGEN</b>

01:13.650 --> 01:14.150
<b>DARY</b>

01:14.150 --> 01:14.610
<b>HERO</b>

01:14.610 --> 01:15.110
<b>IS</b>

01:15.070 --> 01:15.570
<b>DEAD</b>

02:29.000 --> 02:31.960
<b>A New Legendary Hero</b>

02:29.000 --> 02:31.960
<b>Episode 7</b>

02:34.440 --> 02:35.750
Ein Furfur.

02:38.880 --> 02:40.090
And now...

02:40.090 --> 02:41.300
The finish!

02:43.760 --> 02:46.560
The high-rank devil disappeared.

02:46.560 --> 02:49.440
It looked pretty freaked out 
when it attacked the hero.

02:49.910 --> 02:53.430
Maybe it tossed the mid-rank devil 
out as a distraction and fled?

02:53.430 --> 02:56.230
Either way, let's get down there and search.

02:58.130 --> 02:58.990
Colin!

02:58.990 --> 03:00.840
Shit! You gotta be kidding me!

03:00.840 --> 03:01.790
What happened?

03:02.660 --> 03:04.760
Get out! Close the door!

03:07.480 --> 03:09.620
There's a ton of 'em down there!

03:09.620 --> 03:13.760
Do you mean to say they're being controlled
rather than mindlessly rampaging?

03:13.760 --> 03:14.590
No...

03:14.590 --> 03:17.630
I think they're attracted
by sound and voices.

03:17.630 --> 03:18.960
Forget that crap!

03:18.960 --> 03:21.960
We gotta find and kill that 
high-rank devil ASAP!

03:21.960 --> 03:22.940
There it is!

03:24.050 --> 03:26.750
My power failed to work 
on the legendary hero.

03:26.750 --> 03:29.100
And that necromancer as well...

03:31.030 --> 03:32.480
Damn it! I missed!

03:32.480 --> 03:34.190
The hell are you doing?

03:34.190 --> 03:35.920
I'm not becoming a monster today...

03:36.900 --> 03:39.240
We can't let that thing get away!

03:39.240 --> 03:40.870
Hey, you jerk!

03:40.870 --> 03:42.820
It's my turn now, right?

03:43.910 --> 03:45.740
That's it! I'll finish you!

03:47.740 --> 03:50.960
Don't bully my girl that way.

03:51.450 --> 03:53.830
You've got me on the verge of tears.

03:55.750 --> 03:57.710
What're you doing on that horse?

03:57.710 --> 04:00.970
It turns out horses don't get 
infected! Great news, eh?

04:00.970 --> 04:03.590
Don't tell me... You're the mayor! 
You're running away?!

04:03.590 --> 04:05.640
You bet I am.

04:06.670 --> 04:08.470
Hey! Wait, damn it!

04:08.850 --> 04:09.890
Hang in there!

04:09.890 --> 04:11.600
We need to stop the bleeding!

04:15.230 --> 04:17.030
White hair and red eyes...

04:17.030 --> 04:19.110
That guy's a necromancer?

04:19.110 --> 04:21.280
That's Sir Diego!

04:21.280 --> 04:23.860
Hey there, Anri, Hero.

04:23.860 --> 04:25.840
So glad to see you both again.

04:25.840 --> 04:27.950
I dunno who the hell you are.

04:27.950 --> 04:30.390
Come now, you were there too.

04:30.390 --> 04:35.420
I'm aggrieved that you forgot the night 
we spent together in the capital.

04:35.420 --> 04:39.920
Sir Diego, were you the one inhabiting 
the high-rank devil that night?

04:39.920 --> 04:42.880
Oh, right, the guy possessing
the devil I beat...

04:42.880 --> 04:45.510
You're not the one who beat me.

04:45.510 --> 04:48.350
Or were you the one inside the hero, then?

04:48.720 --> 04:50.350
So the hero's dead, is he?

04:50.350 --> 04:53.760
The slayer of the hero 
who defeated the Dark Lord...

04:53.760 --> 04:55.060
Just who are you?

04:55.060 --> 04:56.300
This is Sir Touka!

04:56.300 --> 04:58.640
Hang on a minute! That was an accident!

04:58.640 --> 05:02.030
You certainly seemed overwhelmingly 
powerful that night...

05:02.030 --> 05:05.320
But you're only mana level 4, eh?

05:05.320 --> 05:07.050
<i>It's dropped that much?!</i>

05:07.050 --> 05:10.240
<i>'Cause I got carried away using 
the Sacred Sword and spells and stuff?!</i>

05:10.240 --> 05:12.710
W-Well, when you get as good as me,

05:12.710 --> 05:15.820
you can draw out that much power 
with just mana level 4!

05:15.820 --> 05:18.680
No, Sir Touka uses potions 
to increase his level.

05:18.680 --> 05:20.710
His native mana level is 1.

05:20.710 --> 05:22.130
Why'd you tell him that?!

05:23.660 --> 05:27.590
Mana level 1? Like an insect or a fish?

05:27.590 --> 05:31.600
I'm afraid Sir Touka's talents 
cannot be quantified with mana level.

05:33.190 --> 05:38.770
So if he killed the hero, does that mean 
he agrees with our goal?

05:38.770 --> 05:40.340
Your goal?

05:40.340 --> 05:42.230
Revenge for three years ago?

05:42.230 --> 05:45.440
Yeah, we want revenge.

05:45.830 --> 05:49.200
It's been four months since the seal 
on the Gates of Hell dissolved.

05:49.200 --> 05:52.660
Soon, its miasma will permeate these lands.

05:52.660 --> 05:54.620
In the name of revenge,

05:54.620 --> 05:57.040
we'll bring death to the humans

05:57.040 --> 06:01.090
and fill this world with their corpses!

06:01.090 --> 06:04.300
Are there any other surviving necromancers?

06:04.300 --> 06:05.510
Oh, yes.

06:05.510 --> 06:08.980
Seeing you alive, Anri, made me cry with joy.

06:08.980 --> 06:11.760
Let's all work together to get our revenge.

06:12.050 --> 06:13.600
I fear I cannot do that.

06:14.520 --> 06:17.230
I made a promise to the legendary hero.

06:17.230 --> 06:19.480
A promise to save the world.

06:19.480 --> 06:22.190
Huh? You're kidding, right?

06:22.190 --> 06:23.580
Now, now.

06:23.580 --> 06:26.400
Revenge is a nasty business, man. 
Just call it off.

06:26.400 --> 06:31.990
I heard about folks treating necromancers
as devils and killing 'em off three years ago.

06:31.990 --> 06:35.700
But you could probably talk it out 
now and come to terms.

06:35.700 --> 06:40.460
I can even use the hero's form 
to help convince the king of it!

06:40.460 --> 06:42.920
I, too, shall offer my royal aid!

06:43.830 --> 06:45.170
Talk it out?

06:46.690 --> 06:48.940
What an absolutely ridiculous thought!

06:48.940 --> 06:50.460
If you people would listen,

06:50.460 --> 06:53.790
that slaughter three years ago 
never would've happened!

06:53.790 --> 06:58.370
It was you people—you humans—
who refused to hear us out.

06:59.190 --> 07:01.850
But I'll agree that talk is important...

07:01.850 --> 07:07.530
That's how we managed to forge 
an alliance with the devils.

07:07.530 --> 07:08.880
You've lost your mind!

07:08.880 --> 07:11.050
Have you forgotten our time in Hell?

07:11.050 --> 07:13.050
The devils are our true enemies!

07:13.050 --> 07:14.740
Sorry, Anri.

07:14.740 --> 07:17.190
Our enemies are the humans.

07:17.190 --> 07:19.320
Ein Andromalius.

07:20.360 --> 07:21.580
An eyeball?

07:21.580 --> 07:26.670
To use necromancy, you have to 
know where your target is.

07:27.630 --> 07:32.590
This spell lets me locate a target, 
no matter how far away they are.

07:33.550 --> 07:36.560
Come to me now, my frenzied masses!

07:36.560 --> 07:38.610
But deep down, they're law-abiding citizens!

07:38.610 --> 07:40.810
Dare you kill them?!

07:42.060 --> 07:44.060
He's gotta be almost out of mana, right?

07:44.060 --> 07:45.110
No.

07:45.110 --> 07:46.910
He isn't, Sir Touka.

07:46.910 --> 07:49.630
Necromancers aren't like ordinary humans.

07:49.630 --> 07:52.900
But even if his mana level's high, 
he's gotta hit a limit eventually, right?

07:52.900 --> 07:54.490
Even you run out.

07:54.490 --> 07:58.450
I'm considered a failure among necromancers.

08:00.520 --> 08:02.310
The hell is his mana level?!

08:02.310 --> 08:04.990
The upper limit in humans is level 10.

08:04.990 --> 08:08.920
But necromancers, with bodies adapted
to the conditions of Hell,

08:08.920 --> 08:10.950
can far outstrip that.

08:10.950 --> 08:14.010
Diego's mana level is 40.

08:14.010 --> 08:16.090
F-Forty?!

08:16.980 --> 08:19.770
But it never pulled out my needle.

08:19.770 --> 08:21.100
Ein Furfur!

08:21.100 --> 08:22.870
Ein Vampyr.

08:23.980 --> 08:26.610
I thank you, Lord Diego.

08:26.610 --> 08:28.930
What were you thinking, you pathetic whore?!

08:28.930 --> 08:30.530
Forgive me!

08:30.530 --> 08:32.820
Get the hell out of here until this is over!

08:33.680 --> 08:34.990
Sir Touka!

08:34.990 --> 08:36.450
They're coming!

08:36.450 --> 08:39.790
<i>No idea how long a level 4 
Sacred Sword will hold out, but...</i>

08:40.240 --> 08:41.370
<b>Form Change: Wall</b>

08:43.830 --> 08:45.080
Yes, I see!

08:45.490 --> 08:46.730
Well, then...

08:47.040 --> 08:50.390
If you're the problem here, 
I'd better clear you out first.

08:50.800 --> 08:53.020
<i>Yeah, figures he'd come after me.</i>

08:53.020 --> 08:53.980
<i>Damn...</i>

08:54.770 --> 08:56.220
Hold on a minute!

08:57.090 --> 08:58.790
Surely you have questions, right?

08:58.790 --> 09:03.020
How can a guy who's not the legendary 
hero use the Sacred Sword?

09:03.020 --> 09:05.440
Yes, I suppose I do.

09:05.440 --> 09:07.010
The legendary hero is dead.

09:07.010 --> 09:10.440
I would understand if you were 
still inhabiting his corpse, but...

09:10.440 --> 09:12.730
Who exactly are you?

09:12.730 --> 09:16.190
<i>I dunno why I can use 
the Sacred Sword either...</i>

09:16.190 --> 09:17.990
<i>But now I've got your attention!</i>

09:17.990 --> 09:20.180
You said you wanted revenge, right?

09:20.180 --> 09:23.770
I bet you're riding pretty high, 
getting the devils on your side and all.

09:23.770 --> 09:27.670
But there's one major change
compared to three years ago.

09:27.670 --> 09:30.170
And that would be me.

09:31.470 --> 09:33.130
Remember what Anri said?

09:33.130 --> 09:36.200
My talents can't be 
quantified with mana level.

09:36.200 --> 09:39.650
I killed the legendary hero, 
I can use the guy's Sacred Sword,

09:39.650 --> 09:42.680
and I even put a stop to Leland.

09:42.680 --> 09:44.470
You know why that is?

09:44.470 --> 09:46.360
The answer's simple.

09:46.360 --> 09:49.090
I wield the ultimate power, 
greater even than magic...

09:49.090 --> 09:51.690
The power of lushighs.

09:51.690 --> 09:53.570
<i>"Luscious thighs"?</i>

09:53.570 --> 09:56.780
<i>If you're going to bluff, at least 
come up with a more believable name!</i>

09:57.140 --> 09:58.740
The power of lushighs?

09:58.740 --> 10:00.330
I knew it!

10:00.330 --> 10:02.200
<i>They both bought it!</i>

10:02.200 --> 10:05.020
<i>Is he spinning this bluff to some other end?</i>

10:05.020 --> 10:07.770
<i>Or is he just trying to buy time?</i>

10:07.770 --> 10:10.690
There's no way you can beat me like this.

10:10.690 --> 10:14.860
But if you restore the people 
this instant, I'll spare you.

10:14.860 --> 10:18.020
Lushigh-wielders like me 
are quite magnanimous, you see.

10:18.020 --> 10:21.060
I'll admit you <i>are</i> an unknown.

10:21.060 --> 10:25.630
It would be unwise to recklessly 
throw myself into battle with you.

10:25.630 --> 10:26.910
But...

10:26.910 --> 10:31.880
I can always decide to withdraw after 
that wall breaks down, can't I?

10:32.840 --> 10:35.490
Talents that can't be 
quantified with mana level?

10:35.490 --> 10:36.760
Ridiculous!

10:36.760 --> 10:41.030
You couldn't even use the Sacred 
Sword properly without mana!

10:41.030 --> 10:43.710
Touka, if you use soma drops—

10:43.710 --> 10:45.730
Nah, no need for that.

10:46.150 --> 10:49.210
I'm gonna show you the power within me

10:49.210 --> 10:51.580
that can't be quantified with mana levels!

10:54.170 --> 10:58.270
Guess you didn't realize we had 
another ally on our side.

10:58.270 --> 11:01.090
Lord Diego! Lord Diego!

11:01.090 --> 11:04.050
I asked the mayor to take 
on a little job for us.

11:05.010 --> 11:08.110
You wanna see Marguerite naked in stockings?

11:08.110 --> 11:09.310
If you do...

11:09.310 --> 11:11.460
"Fetch the enchanted carriage," I told him!

11:11.460 --> 11:13.600
You can't just promise something like that!

11:13.600 --> 11:14.940
Your Highness.

11:14.940 --> 11:17.590
I returned to see you naked in stockings.

11:17.590 --> 11:18.820
Absolutely not!

11:18.820 --> 11:20.770
Behold the power of lushighs!

11:20.770 --> 11:24.200
The power to manipulate men 
attracted to luscious thighs!

11:24.780 --> 11:27.320
But how did the mayor know who to hit?

11:27.320 --> 11:30.390
He wasn't here, so he couldn't have known 
that necromancer was our enemy.

11:30.390 --> 11:32.410
Got my message, did you?

11:32.410 --> 11:33.520
Yes.

11:33.520 --> 11:36.070
It's not too obvious from up close.

11:35.710 --> 11:38.000
<b>"Dude with the white hair is the enemy!"</b>

11:38.000 --> 11:40.090
Anri, remote necromancy.

11:40.090 --> 11:40.980
Yes!

11:40.980 --> 11:42.220
All right...

11:42.220 --> 11:44.720
Now to defeat the high-rank devil.

11:49.270 --> 11:52.810
Not bad for a bunch of pathetic nobodies!

11:52.810 --> 11:55.400
No way! He's still kicking?!

11:55.990 --> 11:58.360
You stole my control, eh?

11:58.360 --> 12:01.320
I must've lost focus 
for a split second there...

12:01.320 --> 12:05.100
But I wonder how long you can keep them
under control with your mana level!

12:05.100 --> 12:08.030
Though if you use all of them, 
you might just stand a chance!

12:08.030 --> 12:10.170
That won't be necessary!

12:10.170 --> 12:12.870
I brought some powerful reinforcements!

12:12.870 --> 12:15.830
Indeed, your true hope is here...

12:15.830 --> 12:19.300
Now that the legendary hero 
Milly Yunis has arrived!

12:19.300 --> 12:20.210
Milly?

12:20.580 --> 12:23.180
Huh? What're you doing here...

12:23.180 --> 12:24.610
Big Sis?

12:26.720 --> 12:28.760
Why are <i>you</i> here?

12:28.760 --> 12:30.350
We could ask you the same thing!

12:30.350 --> 12:31.800
<i>Yuna's dad?!</i>

12:31.800 --> 12:34.250
I told you to stay in the village!

12:34.910 --> 12:38.520
But Princess Marguerite... 
you've certainly grown, haven't you?

12:38.930 --> 12:40.450
<i>I just remembered...</i>

12:40.450 --> 12:45.200
<i>This lousy creep can't stop himself 
from perving on boobs!</i>

12:45.200 --> 12:47.350
Enough of this farce.

12:47.350 --> 12:50.040
There can't be two legendary heroes.

12:50.040 --> 12:51.830
Then let me show you...

12:51.830 --> 12:55.170
the power of my Sacred Sword, Durandal!

12:58.790 --> 13:00.670
Yunisian Fighting Technique...

13:00.670 --> 13:01.850
Fire-Thunder!

13:04.010 --> 13:05.840
Ein Nidhogg.

13:06.800 --> 13:09.510
Awesome! You beat him!

13:09.510 --> 13:11.470
Lord Diego! Lord Diego!

13:11.820 --> 13:14.970
Gotta appreciate nice tits, 
even on an enemy.

13:14.970 --> 13:18.030
That one! That's the one 
enslaving the townspeople!

13:18.030 --> 13:19.440
All right.

13:19.440 --> 13:21.080
Your tits are absurd!

13:21.080 --> 13:22.400
With my own hands, I will—

13:23.900 --> 13:25.020
Papa!

13:26.280 --> 13:27.820
Even after all that...

13:27.820 --> 13:29.780
Oh, how very amusing!

13:29.780 --> 13:31.810
So amusing, I could cry!

13:31.810 --> 13:34.960
You're not just pathetic 
nobodies after all!

13:34.960 --> 13:41.020
But this is all a distraction 
from my original goal.

13:42.420 --> 13:44.420
We'll finish another time.

13:44.420 --> 13:46.020
You shan't escape!

13:46.020 --> 13:48.220
Ah, but here's a word to the wise...

13:48.220 --> 13:51.140
That spell is devil-conversion magic.

13:51.140 --> 13:54.970
In about a day, they'll 
begin turning into devils,

13:54.970 --> 13:57.940
starting with the ones 
with the lowest mana levels.

13:57.940 --> 14:00.190
<i>The lowest mana levels? Yuna!</i>

14:00.190 --> 14:02.680
At that point,
even if you slay the caster here,

14:02.680 --> 14:03.880
they're done for!

14:03.880 --> 14:07.150
They'll be man-eating monsters 
for the rest of their lives!

14:07.150 --> 14:09.350
Now, struggle all you like!

14:09.350 --> 14:13.800
I'll enjoy watching you from afar.

14:13.800 --> 14:16.370
And if you survive, perhaps we'll meet again!

14:18.330 --> 14:20.900
Touka, why did you stop me?

14:20.900 --> 14:22.420
Anri's at her limit.

14:22.420 --> 14:26.380
If he'd stayed any longer, 
the tables would've turned again.

14:26.950 --> 14:29.980
Let's lure them in with sound 
and seal them in the mansion.

14:29.980 --> 14:31.180
All right.

14:32.050 --> 14:36.110
That was the explosion spell 
the mid-rank devil used on the roof.

14:36.470 --> 14:38.520
I'll use it to draw them in.

14:39.330 --> 14:40.480
Master Fieri.

14:40.480 --> 14:42.330
Let me use a healing spell to—

14:42.330 --> 14:43.060
No.

14:43.060 --> 14:45.530
Take care of him first.

14:46.280 --> 14:50.780
Will this counteract the spell 
that thing cast on me?

14:50.780 --> 14:53.850
No, I'm afraid that's beyond my capabilities.

14:53.850 --> 14:54.990
I'm sorry.

14:54.990 --> 14:57.640
Damn. So I'm gonna become a monster?

14:57.640 --> 14:59.710
I can't freaking believe this...

14:59.710 --> 15:02.650
Hey. You said you had the power of ludicrous?

15:02.650 --> 15:03.920
Lushighs.

15:03.920 --> 15:04.860
Here.

15:05.240 --> 15:06.880
Take this, okay?

15:07.580 --> 15:09.960
It's my magic crystals and enchanted tools.

15:09.960 --> 15:12.840
Use them in your fight, would you?

15:13.600 --> 15:17.040
I like playing the trickster myself.

15:17.040 --> 15:20.560
The way you fight is so
ludicrous. I loved it.

15:20.560 --> 15:23.910
I feel like I can trust my life to you.

15:23.910 --> 15:28.170
It's ludicrous guys like you 
that actually give me hope.

15:29.590 --> 15:30.820
You got it.

15:31.420 --> 15:33.640
I swear I'll beat that devil.

15:33.640 --> 15:36.890
There's someone I've gotta save, too.

15:39.700 --> 15:43.070
I'll protect this place if it comes to it.

15:43.070 --> 15:44.550
I'm counting on you.

15:44.550 --> 15:46.240
Don't worry. We got this.

15:52.300 --> 15:55.050
I'm going to report this to the capital.

15:55.050 --> 15:56.420
Don't chicken out, okay?

15:56.420 --> 15:58.100
I won't run away again.

15:58.100 --> 15:59.950
As mayor of this city,

15:59.950 --> 16:01.880
and so I can see you naked in stockings,

16:01.880 --> 16:04.150
I <i>will</i> do my duty!

16:04.150 --> 16:05.900
I told you that's not happening!

16:05.900 --> 16:10.520
I'll make sure we take out that 
devil in the next 24 hours.

16:10.520 --> 16:12.460
I won't let anyone transform.

16:13.280 --> 16:17.240
But how will we know where 
that necromancer and devil went?

16:17.240 --> 16:22.080
Based on the way he was talking,
I'm guessing they ran off to their base.

16:22.920 --> 16:24.940
The direction they flew off in

16:24.940 --> 16:29.930
intersects with the northeast path from
the capital that Siruela described

16:29.930 --> 16:32.660
right about at the perfect
place for a hideout.

16:33.090 --> 16:36.040
Me and Yuna's hometown, Elvania.

16:36.040 --> 16:39.550
Elvania was destroyed 
by devils three years ago.

16:41.340 --> 16:44.600
At this rate, we'll reach Elvania 
in about twelve hours.

16:44.600 --> 16:48.060
Since we don't all know each other, 
we oughta have some introductions.

16:48.060 --> 16:48.890
Me, me!

16:48.890 --> 16:50.570
I'll go first!

16:50.570 --> 16:52.760
My name's Milly Yunis!

16:51.690 --> 16:54.570
<b>Milly Yunis
Legendary Hero (?)</b>

16:52.760 --> 16:54.100
I'm a legendary hero!

16:54.100 --> 16:55.060
I'm sixteen years old.

16:55.060 --> 16:58.330
My likes include cheesecake 
and fighting powerful enemies!

16:58.330 --> 17:00.670
I'm 155 centimeters tall, 
and my measurements are—

17:00.670 --> 17:02.080
Nobody freaking asked!

17:02.080 --> 17:04.720
Also, are you serious about 
this "legendary hero" stuff?

17:04.720 --> 17:06.290
We'll discuss that later.

17:06.290 --> 17:09.670
I'm Yuna and Milly's father.

17:06.670 --> 17:09.960
<b>Fieri Yunis
Yuna and Milly's Father</b>

17:09.670 --> 17:12.070
My likes include my daughters and boobs.

17:12.070 --> 17:15.260
I'm pleased to be surrounded 
by so many brilliant bazongas.

17:15.260 --> 17:17.640
What a creepy self-introduction.

17:17.640 --> 17:19.950
Pleased to see you again, Master Fieri.

17:19.950 --> 17:22.720
The pleasure is all mine, Your Highness.

17:22.720 --> 17:25.440
I never expected to find you 
traveling with Sion the hero!

17:25.440 --> 17:27.250
You guys know each other?

17:27.250 --> 17:29.790
Master Fieri used to be
one of the Four Knights.

17:30.420 --> 17:35.070
Isaac was beside himself when he 
left the capital four years ago.

17:35.070 --> 17:36.830
Why <i>did</i> you leave the Knights?

17:37.790 --> 17:41.550
As a team-building exercise, 
I made a play for the female knights' tits

17:41.550 --> 17:43.450
and got accused of sexual harassment.

17:43.450 --> 17:48.150
In the end, I was stripped of my title 
and exiled from the capital.

17:48.150 --> 17:49.540
Sounds like you deserved it!

17:49.540 --> 17:50.440
Perhaps.

17:50.440 --> 17:53.050
But Siruela, my direct subordinate...

17:53.050 --> 17:55.090
She had the finest knockers of all.

17:55.090 --> 17:57.600
Guess she's been through a lot, huh?

17:57.940 --> 17:59.300
Okay, what about you?

17:59.300 --> 18:01.160
I'm Shannon Petralca.

17:59.300 --> 18:02.260
<b>Shannon Petralca
Mage</b>

18:01.160 --> 18:02.260
I'm a mage.

18:02.600 --> 18:05.020
C'mon, Dorothy! Wake up!

18:02.890 --> 18:05.730
<b>Dorothy Eleonara
Mage</b>

18:06.180 --> 18:11.130
Um... "Dorothy Eleonara. 
I'm a mage. Good night."

18:11.130 --> 18:12.500
"Good night"?!

18:12.500 --> 18:14.690
"P.S., Sion and Anri..."

18:14.690 --> 18:18.450
"It's good to see you again. 
Good night," she says.

18:18.450 --> 18:19.910
You guys know each other?

18:19.910 --> 18:23.370
She was once part of the hero's party.

18:23.370 --> 18:25.100
<i>She was with them?</i>

18:25.100 --> 18:28.550
<i>What's she gonna do 
if she finds out Sion's dead?</i>

18:28.550 --> 18:31.950
<i>Worse, Anri said the hero was 
the only one who accepted her.</i>

18:31.950 --> 18:34.840
<i>Does that mean Dorothy might try 
to kill Anri the way Kyle did?!</i>

18:34.840 --> 18:36.940
Now, Sir Hero...

18:36.940 --> 18:41.050
Might I ask how you came to travel 
with my daughter and the princess?

18:42.820 --> 18:44.390
Why won't you respond?

18:44.390 --> 18:48.200
H-He feels kinda guilty about 
the Gates of Hell getting unsealed.

18:48.200 --> 18:51.150
He swore he'd focus on nothing but 
his battle until he saved the world,

18:51.150 --> 18:52.360
and he's been this way since!

18:52.360 --> 18:54.400
Incredible! Such depth of resolve!

18:54.400 --> 18:55.730
I'm so impressed!

18:55.730 --> 18:57.170
<i>Whew, they bought it!</i>

18:57.170 --> 18:59.250
I've been wondering this for a while,

18:59.250 --> 19:01.480
by why do you sound like that, Big Sis?

19:02.030 --> 19:03.340
I mean the way you're talking.

19:03.340 --> 19:05.010
You sound like Touka.

19:05.010 --> 19:07.610
<i>Crap! I forgot to stay in character!</i>

19:07.610 --> 19:12.000
Uh, we've been hanging out for so long,
 he kinda rubbed off on me.

19:12.000 --> 19:13.230
Don't tell me...

19:13.230 --> 19:16.210
You're not gonna steal my Touka, are you?!

19:16.210 --> 19:19.190
Wh-What exactly is your 
relationship to Touka?

19:19.190 --> 19:20.930
We said we'd get married one day!

19:21.680 --> 19:23.240
Tou— Er, Yuna.

19:23.240 --> 19:25.660
Heck no! That's not binding or anything!

19:25.660 --> 19:28.630
She just challenged me 
to a duel this one time, and...

19:28.630 --> 19:31.190
If I beat you, do you promise to marry me?

19:31.190 --> 19:34.610
You think a little girl like you can beat <i>me</i>?

19:35.610 --> 19:36.730
I win!

19:36.730 --> 19:39.950
Hang on! I never said only one match!

19:39.950 --> 19:43.540
You gotta beat me a hundred times to win!

19:43.540 --> 19:45.450
Aw... Okay, then!

19:45.790 --> 19:50.400
So she kept challenging me
and beating the crap outta me.

19:50.400 --> 19:54.220
Yuna finally got sick of watching it 
and stepped in to save me.

19:54.220 --> 19:57.040
But why in the world did you 
agree to that, anyway?!

19:57.040 --> 19:59.050
It's just the kind of thing kids do!

19:59.050 --> 20:00.690
Touka Scott...

20:00.690 --> 20:04.010
I never expected him to have 
such an influence on my daughters.

20:04.570 --> 20:07.500
That disgusting pervert 
with his thigh fetish...

20:07.500 --> 20:09.600
I'll have to take him off 
the table once and for all!

20:09.600 --> 20:14.140
<i>Oh yeah, I forgot about all the times 
this guy tried to kill me, too!</i>

20:14.140 --> 20:16.440
<i>Yuna's the only one who was nice to me!</i>

20:16.780 --> 20:19.780
Yuna, when this is over, 
return to the village.

20:20.490 --> 20:22.580
Leave the fight to us

20:22.580 --> 20:24.800
and live out a peaceful life there.

20:25.280 --> 20:28.680
I mean, that sounds nice and all...

20:28.680 --> 20:30.960
But you can't tie people down.

20:30.960 --> 20:31.800
Yuna's...

20:31.800 --> 20:35.600
I mean, I-I've got a dream 
to be a mage and stuff.

20:35.600 --> 20:37.710
You're still on that nonsense?

20:37.710 --> 20:40.110
You have no magical talent.

20:40.110 --> 20:43.230
Return to the village, and never 
get involved with magic again!

20:43.230 --> 20:44.910
That's an order.

20:44.910 --> 20:48.390
<i>What kind of asshole is that down 
on his daughter's dreams?</i>

20:48.390 --> 20:51.720
<i>Though I did forget Yuna comes
from a house of famous fighters.</i>

20:51.720 --> 20:53.350
<i>Is that why?</i>

20:54.810 --> 20:57.420
Well, we can talk about that later.

20:57.420 --> 21:00.360
What I wanna know is why Milly's 
calling herself the hero—

21:03.240 --> 21:04.240
What the...

21:04.240 --> 21:05.810
What's going on?

21:07.480 --> 21:09.410
Was the test successful?

21:09.410 --> 21:13.770
Yeah, in just three days, everyone 
in town was under the spell's thrall.

21:13.770 --> 21:18.120
And she only cast it directly
 on a single person!

21:18.120 --> 21:20.370
It's wonderfully compatible 
with necromancy as well.

21:20.370 --> 21:25.690
Unlike Leland, this devil will be a valuable 
resource in taking over the capital.

21:25.690 --> 21:28.850
I am honored to be of use to you.

21:28.850 --> 21:30.480
You pathetic whore.

21:30.480 --> 21:34.060
Then you got overconfident and walked 
right into the mansion where the hero was.

21:34.420 --> 21:38.020
You almost ruined our whole damn plan!

21:40.940 --> 21:42.640
The hero was there?

21:43.700 --> 21:47.810
Oh, yes! And we've started 
playing a fun little game...

21:48.360 --> 21:52.010
I approached anyone I thought 
might be willing to help.

21:52.010 --> 21:54.300
I asked them to hunt the hero!

21:54.300 --> 21:58.210
Let's see if even one of them gets this far.

21:58.210 --> 22:01.410
They'll find themselves 
facing a thousand devils!

22:01.410 --> 22:05.640
The minute they arrive, 
it'll be game over!

22:07.880 --> 22:10.010
<b>21 hours until Yuna and the others become devils</b>

22:10.050 --> 22:21.150
<b>Next Time</b>

22:11.070 --> 22:21.150
<b>The Legendary Hero Is a Student!</b>
